具，避免露营地“末日”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Compost your cutlery and avoid campsite ‘Armageddon’: how music festivals are going sustainable</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">随着公众环保意识的提升，全球各大音乐节正积极探索可持续发展路径，通过推广使用可堆肥餐具等方式，减少环境污染和资源浪费，以期避免露营地垃圾泛滥的“末日”景象。（环保视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲卫报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.straitstimes.com/asia/east-asia/seouls-golden-ginkgo-trees-have-a-stinky-problem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">首尔金色银杏树的“臭味”困扰</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Seoul’s golden ginkgo trees have a stinky problem</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">每年秋季，韩国首尔街头的金黄色银杏树虽然美不胜收，但其果实散发的特殊气味却困扰着当地居民和游客。市政部门正尝试通过管理措施来解决这一独特的城市环境问题。（城市生活视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">海峡时报(新加坡)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.japantimes.co.jp/business/2026/11/14/companies/nvidia-arm-ceo-haas-huang/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">报道称英伟达接触Arm首席执行官哈斯，员工则希望黄仁勋回归</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Nvidia approaches Arm CEO Haas as employees seek Huang’s return, reports say</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">据市场传闻，英伟达（Nvidia）正与芯片设计公司Arm的首席执行官雷内·哈斯（Rene Haas）进行接触，而与此同时，英伟达内部员工也表达了希望创始人黄仁勋回归领导岗位的意愿，显示公司高层人事变动或将引发关注。（财经报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">日本时报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-11-14/man-dead-armstrong-creek-house-fire-geelong/107385832\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">吉朗一栋房屋发生火灾后一人死亡</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Man dies after house fire in Geelong</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">澳大利亚维多利亚州吉朗地区一栋住宅发生火灾，导致一人不幸死亡。当地消防和警方已介入调查火灾原因，提醒公众关注家庭消防安全，避免类似悲剧发生。（地方新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲ABC新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/new-orleans-usa-tanker-ship-river-cruise-crash-updates/article71699607.ece\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">油轮在新奥尔良密西西比河与游船相撞，救援行动正在进行</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Tanker hits a river cruise boat on Mississippi River in New Orleans; rescue operations under way</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一艘油轮在美国新奥尔良的密西西比河上与一艘载有298人的游船相撞，导致游船受损，目前救援行动正在紧张进行，以确保乘客和船员的安全。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">印度教徒报</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/11/14/newsroom-daily-quiz-saturday-14-november/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">新闻编辑室每日小测验：11月14日星期六</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Newsroom daily quiz, Saturday 14 November</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">这是一份供读者参与的每日新闻小测验，涵盖了2020年11月14日星期六当天发生的重要新闻事件，旨在测试读者对时事新闻的了解程度，具有互动性和趣味性。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/emergencies_local/2592512/west-auckland-mall-evacuated-after-battery-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">西奥克兰一购物中心因电池起火被疏散</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">West Auckland mall evacuated after battery fire</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰西奥克兰的一家购物中心因一起电池火灾引发浓烟，导致整个建筑被紧急疏散，尽管火势不大，但出于安全考虑，消防部门迅速采取了应对措施。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/sport/361059331/fickle-australians-desperate-lap-pat-cummins-implausib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">反复无常的澳大利亚人急于接受帕特·卡明斯那不可思议的说法</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Fickle Australians desperate to lap up Pat Cummins’ implausible version of events</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">澳大利亚板球界围绕队长帕特·卡明斯对一项争议事件的解释引发热议，有观点认为公众急于相信其不甚可信的说法，反映出对英雄人物的盲目支持或媒体塑造的影响。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Stuff新闻</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌐 中东·非洲·全球南方</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/13/faa-grounds-all-fights-across-the-us-over-telecommunication?traffic_source=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国联邦航空管理局因“电信中断”导致全国航班停飞</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">FAA grounds all fights across the US over ‘telecommunication outage’</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国联邦航空管理局（FAA）因系统出现“电信中断”故障，导致全国范围内的所有航班被迫停飞，这一突发事件严重影响了航空运输，具体原因仍在调查中。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">半岛电视台(卡塔尔)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cklyw3neqg2wo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国签证限制下，非洲环球小姐佳丽前途未卜</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">African Miss Universe beauty queens in limbo as US visa restrictions bite</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">由于美国收紧签证政策，多位非洲国家的环球小姐参赛者面临签证获取困难，导致她们无法如期前往美国参加比赛，这使得她们的前途充满不确定性。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC非洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm75261e3pdko?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">联合国机构对伊朗一核设施未受核查表示“日益担忧”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">UN watchdog &#x27;increasingly concerned&#x27; over uninspected Iran nuclear site</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">国际原子能机构（IAEA）总干事格罗西表示，伊朗马尔卡兹（Marvdasht）核设施的监控设备已损坏且未被修复，使得该机构无法核实伊朗核计划的和平性质，加剧了国际社会对其核意图的担忧。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中东</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwg7l8n7dx5mo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">秘鲁城市将教皇利奥十三世尊为本地圣人</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">The Peruvian city that has embraced Pope Leo as one of its own</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在秘鲁库斯科地区的一个偏远小镇，当地居民对教皇利奥十三世抱有特殊的崇敬，将其视为守护神并举行纪念活动，这反映了秘鲁天主教信仰与本土文化的独特融合，以及对历史人物的深厚情感寄托。（文化视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC拉丁美洲</span></div></div>\n</div></div>"
